WEBVTT

00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:42.780
Someone broke the shintai mirror?!

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:11.270
Ensei-san, you're the one who broke the mirror!

00:02:11.270 --> 00:02:12.310
How could you?!

00:02:12.600 --> 00:02:14.110
Hold on, I don't know anything about—

00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:15.530
I don't want to hear any excuses.

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:18.170
If it was you, it couldn't be helped.

00:02:18.170 --> 00:02:21.210
You wouldn't have known, and you seem like someone who would do it, too.

00:02:21.210 --> 00:02:22.710
Just wait a second!

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:31.380
This must be it.

00:02:31.780 --> 00:02:38.020
Supposedly, Sou Youki suppressed the 108 monsters by playing this erhu.

00:02:38.020 --> 00:02:40.650
Even if my skill cannot match hers...

00:03:00.470 --> 00:03:01.880
The earthquake has...

00:03:11.150 --> 00:03:13.070
Please leave now.

00:03:13.070 --> 00:03:16.800
Shuurei-sama is fine. She's only asleep.

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:20.520
All right.

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:30.430
The earthquake has stopped.

00:03:30.950 --> 00:03:32.730
But this rain...

00:03:32.730 --> 00:03:34.940
Can you do something about it,

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:36.800
Ran Ryuuren?

00:03:39.310 --> 00:03:44.240
Unlike a foolish brother of mine,
I always perform my duties perfectly.

00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:07.440
As expected of you, Ryuuren...

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:17.660
Shuurei!
Shuurei-dono!

00:04:23.990 --> 00:04:26.990
Whoa, what should I do? The rope could snap at any time.

00:04:26.990 --> 00:04:29.720
Does this mean I should escape?

00:04:31.850 --> 00:04:34.280
21 years old, is he?

00:04:34.900 --> 00:04:41.420
If I'm having a rough time as a low-ranking official, the Emperor must lead an even tougher life.

00:04:42.990 --> 00:04:44.530
The boat can't take much more of this.

00:04:44.530 --> 00:04:46.280
Where will the river take us if the rope breaks?

00:04:46.280 --> 00:04:47.450
Isn't anyone coming?

00:04:49.290 --> 00:04:53.720
Tan-tan! I'm sorry we took so long!

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:02.050
He has a fever.

00:05:04.130 --> 00:05:05.280
Ryuuki...

00:05:10.170 --> 00:05:15.790
A high-spirited mushroom baby is dancing around a cute panda.

00:05:18.770 --> 00:05:20.750
This is pretty serious.

00:05:22.020 --> 00:05:24.260
Let me go, you insect of a general!

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:26.270
No way.

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:30.010
Just... let... me...

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:30.760
Ouch!

00:05:32.090 --> 00:05:33.520
Jyuusan-hime's still...

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:40.610
Ensei-dono, if I don't return in fifteen minutes, please leave.

00:05:47.460 --> 00:05:50.990
You've forgotten one last thing, Shuuei.

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:52.160
Jin!

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:54.560
How did you manage to silence her?

00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:56.710
Well, I'm used to it, after all.

00:05:56.710 --> 00:06:01.840
She scratched me a lot, but that's nothing.

00:06:03.150 --> 00:06:05.630
Go, Shuuei.

00:06:08.980 --> 00:06:11.140
I'm glad for you, Shusui.

00:06:11.560 --> 00:06:14.140
It was worth coming all the way to Kyuusai Cove, wasn't it?

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:20.150
Shuuei, your sailing skills haven't gone rusty, have they?

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:23.650
You'd better not let these turbid waters make you capsize.

00:06:28.140 --> 00:06:29.240
Shusui-dono!

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:30.910
Shusui, wait!

00:06:30.910 --> 00:06:33.860
Shusui... hold on!

00:06:43.220 --> 00:06:46.360
I cannot go back. Farewell.

00:06:47.910 --> 00:06:51.470
Shusui-dono... One day, I will...

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:01.820
Are you sure about this?

00:07:01.820 --> 00:07:04.620
I told you: I can't run away anymore.

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:07.700
I'm tired of hiding in fear.

00:07:07.700 --> 00:07:11.200
I've decided to take care of my own problems.

00:07:13.340 --> 00:07:17.820
That's why I cannot go back with you, Shouka-sama.

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:22.710
You know what will happen to you if you stay here.

00:07:23.060 --> 00:07:25.960
Shusui, Ruka won't forgive you.

00:07:25.960 --> 00:07:27.520
I know.

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:34.970
Even so, it'll be worse if I escape now and end up hindering you and the others.

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:37.690
I can protect you at the very least.

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:38.820
Let's go home.

00:07:38.820 --> 00:07:42.690
But Shouka-sama, it's painful and distressing to run.

00:07:44.350 --> 00:07:46.020
Please go.

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:50.430
Even if I have no chance of winning,
I cannot make someone else do this.

00:07:51.480 --> 00:07:54.610
Thank you for coming to take me back.

00:07:54.610 --> 00:07:55.840
Shouka-sama...

00:07:58.240 --> 00:07:59.460
Farewell.

00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:07.890
Everybody's sleeping peacefully.

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:13.170
They must've been exhausted. They're in a deep sleep.

00:08:13.170 --> 00:08:14.410
I see.

00:08:14.410 --> 00:08:17.600
Shuuei-san, you should rest too.

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:22.060
No, I still have an important job to do.

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:25.860
They're waiting in the back room.

00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:29.440
Excuse me.

00:08:29.890 --> 00:08:33.200
Brothers, please make a bet with me.

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:40.610
If you win, I'll obey your orders.

00:08:40.610 --> 00:08:41.580
However...

00:08:42.350 --> 00:08:44.100
if I win...

00:08:44.100 --> 00:08:46.830
Very well, Shuuei.

00:08:47.480 --> 00:08:48.500
We'll make a bet.

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:51.740
But you know this better than anyone, don't you?

00:08:51.740 --> 00:08:57.840
We've never lost this bet, not even once.

00:09:12.270 --> 00:09:14.380
Did something happen to you, Father?

00:09:15.460 --> 00:09:18.170
You look sad.

00:09:18.170 --> 00:09:23.840
Well, I was just thinking that it's heartbreaking when children become independent from their parents.

00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:24.590
What?

00:09:25.220 --> 00:09:27.580
Never mind. You should sleep a little longer.

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:39.580
Father?!

00:09:39.580 --> 00:09:41.010
What're you doing in Ranshuu?!

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:47.020
Umm, well, the Emperor asked me to go with him.

00:09:47.020 --> 00:09:48.480
Is that so?

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:50.460
Yes, it is.

00:09:50.460 --> 00:09:52.790
But, where have you been up till now?

00:09:52.790 --> 00:09:56.030
You weren't with Ryuuki or Jyuusan-hime, were you?

00:09:56.030 --> 00:09:57.510
That's because...

00:10:01.550 --> 00:10:06.540
Yes, Kokurou helped me and brought me here.

00:10:06.540 --> 00:10:10.000
Wow, so you met Kokurou?

00:10:10.340 --> 00:10:15.970
Umm, I met him... or, umm, how should I put this...

00:10:15.970 --> 00:10:17.260
Right...

00:10:38.870 --> 00:10:40.660
I'm glad.

00:11:06.380 --> 00:11:07.720
Shuuei.

00:11:09.720 --> 00:11:11.980
You're awake?

00:11:13.710 --> 00:11:16.480
Your fever has gone down, too.

00:11:19.810 --> 00:11:22.870
Shouka-sama arrived earlier as well.

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:24.510
I see.

00:11:25.270 --> 00:11:30.950
I left Jyuusan-hime and Shouka by the boat, and wandered into the mountains alone.

00:11:30.950 --> 00:11:36.010
In retrospect, I must've been completely mad.

00:11:36.430 --> 00:11:38.590
Well, aren't you always like that?

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:39.870
What did you say?!

00:11:43.920 --> 00:11:47.640
Your Highness, about Jyuusan-hime and Jin...

00:11:48.850 --> 00:11:50.810
Come in!

00:11:52.350 --> 00:11:54.100
What are you doing?

00:11:55.800 --> 00:11:58.860
My body will stiffen up if I lie down all the time.

00:12:00.010 --> 00:12:02.000
You've come to ask me about Jin, right?

00:12:02.400 --> 00:12:03.460
Sit down.

00:12:03.460 --> 00:12:07.290
Is it okay for Ensei and Tan-tan to hear this, for the record?

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:09.870
Yeah, it's all right.

00:12:17.780 --> 00:12:20.650
I heard about Jin from Jyuusan-hime herself.

00:12:21.210 --> 00:12:25.330
That Jin murdered his own father and was sentenced to death.

00:12:25.330 --> 00:12:26.220
That's right.

00:12:26.990 --> 00:12:30.630
After the sentence, Jyuusan-hime climbed up the Valley of the Lost

00:12:30.630 --> 00:12:33.430
to Kyuusai Cove, despite getting lost along the way.

00:12:33.430 --> 00:12:35.020
She did it all by herself.

00:12:35.370 --> 00:12:40.780
She wanted to make the three eldest brothers of the Ran family stop Jin's execution.

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:42.980
Jin's execution was st—

00:12:42.980 --> 00:12:44.780
I won't listen to anything more about that.

00:12:45.220 --> 00:12:50.290
I was not the official involved in that case,
and there's no way of knowing what truly happened.

00:12:51.600 --> 00:12:55.790
I'm not saying this to protect you or Ran-shogun.

00:12:56.160 --> 00:12:58.480
Even if that was Jyuusan-hime's desire,

00:12:58.480 --> 00:13:03.550
I doubt that the Ran family would do anything to jeopardize its position.

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:11.310
If Shiba Jin is now living as Shun, someone else circumvented the law and saved his life.

00:13:12.170 --> 00:13:14.870
Seiga came to Ranshuu,

00:13:14.870 --> 00:13:19.440
but even he didn't take action because he knew he had no chance against "someone."

00:13:19.440 --> 00:13:22.690
In other words, that "someone" is a very important political figure.

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:26.380
He must be either Minister Son of the Ministry of Defense,

00:13:26.380 --> 00:13:28.050
who was Ranshuu's governor at the time,

00:13:29.190 --> 00:13:31.530
or Secretary Ou Ki of the Department of Counsel,

00:13:31.530 --> 00:13:33.800
who ran the Section of Government Inspection back then.

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:40.680
Either way, until I'm sure I can bring them down, it's best not to make a move against them.

00:13:42.680 --> 00:13:47.220
This is only hypothetical, but if I'd been the official in charge of Jin-san's case,

00:13:47.220 --> 00:13:49.120
and he'd been sentenced to death,

00:13:49.120 --> 00:13:55.310
I'd probably have executed him, in accordance with the law.

00:13:55.950 --> 00:14:01.820
Even if someone secretly asked me to save his life and to pretend that he'd been executed,

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:05.320
I wouldn't have done it because an official can't make exceptions.

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:11.660
However, if I'd reflected on the circumstances before I passed sentence,

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:14.540
and I thought that I could mitigate his misconduct,

00:14:14.900 --> 00:14:17.720
I'd have taken the path of challenging the Ministry of Justice,

00:14:17.720 --> 00:14:20.000
or someone else, to change the law itself.

00:14:21.740 --> 00:14:24.600
To stop the execution of Jin-san,

00:14:24.600 --> 00:14:27.140
and for the sake of the girl that Jin-san protected,

00:14:27.140 --> 00:14:30.010
I'd have done everything I could

00:14:30.010 --> 00:14:32.470
to save Jin-san's life.

00:14:32.870 --> 00:14:35.770
So that everyone could walk in the sunlight.

00:14:35.770 --> 00:14:42.080
So that even an ordinary person, unrelated to the Ran or Shiba families, might be saved.

00:14:42.680 --> 00:14:46.190
Yep, that sounds way better.

00:14:46.190 --> 00:14:48.200
You really are clever.

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:49.790
I agree as well.

00:14:49.790 --> 00:14:54.530
If we were in that situation, I'd do everything to make your dreams come true.

00:15:00.360 --> 00:15:01.740
I'm sorry.

00:15:03.410 --> 00:15:06.040
Well, it's only hypothetical.

00:15:06.040 --> 00:15:08.090
Please don't cry.

00:15:17.150 --> 00:15:19.900
Why did you tell me about Jyuusan-hime and Shiba Jin?

00:15:19.900 --> 00:15:23.000
You're going to invite Jyuusan-hime into the Imperial Residence, aren't you?

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:24.660
Then you have to know about it.

00:15:24.660 --> 00:15:26.730
Yes, that's my intention.

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:32.790
Shuuei, we're somehow walking together now...

00:15:35.570 --> 00:15:37.660
but I want you back.

00:15:38.060 --> 00:15:41.500
As the Emperor, I want Ran Shuuei back.

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:42.880
Please come back.

00:15:44.110 --> 00:15:46.240
I want an ally.

00:15:46.240 --> 00:15:48.850
I don't want a friend.

00:15:48.850 --> 00:15:51.420
As the Emperor, I want Ran Shuuei.

00:15:52.190 --> 00:15:56.860
I need the Ran Shuuei who will stand by my side no matter what happens.

00:15:56.860 --> 00:15:58.930
In return, I'll become an Emperor worthy of your service.

00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:01.670
I want you as my vassal.

00:16:01.670 --> 00:16:04.060
I want your heartfelt loyalty.

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:05.810
I want your entire life.

00:16:16.460 --> 00:16:18.620
Please choose me, Shuuei.

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:20.750
I chose you.

00:16:20.750 --> 00:16:22.580
That's why I came here.

00:16:24.740 --> 00:16:29.000
Your Highness, the Ran family has disowned me.

00:16:30.080 --> 00:16:36.340
I made a bet that I could tell the three eldest brothers of the family apart.

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:40.770
Until now, only Gyokuka-aneue has ever been able to do that.

00:16:41.780 --> 00:16:46.540
If I won the bet, I asked them to
disown me from the Ran family...

00:16:48.720 --> 00:16:51.750
And I won the bet.

00:16:54.130 --> 00:16:57.240
The Ran family will not obey you, at least not for now.

00:16:57.240 --> 00:16:59.390
Therefore, they don't want to see you either.

00:17:00.150 --> 00:17:04.810
You'll only gain me, even though you came all the way here.

00:17:05.410 --> 00:17:09.000
I cannot use the power of the Ran family anymore.

00:17:09.400 --> 00:17:10.840
Even so...

00:17:11.140 --> 00:17:12.810
Even so, what?

00:17:12.810 --> 00:17:16.260
My only goal in coming here was to get you back.

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:17.360
That's more than enough for me.

00:17:17.360 --> 00:17:19.510
T-To get me back?

00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:21.860
What, you won't let me take you back?

00:17:21.860 --> 00:17:23.500
What is it? What do you want?

00:17:23.500 --> 00:17:29.830
T-To tell the truth, I don't own much,
but if you want something of mine...

00:17:34.150 --> 00:17:36.610
Well, I'll answer you with my sword.

00:18:07.460 --> 00:18:09.290
I don't believe it.

00:18:09.290 --> 00:18:11.330
What don't you believe?

00:18:11.330 --> 00:18:13.520
It's about real ability, about true strength.

00:18:13.520 --> 00:18:15.690
The difference between Your Highness's
strength and mine is something like that.

00:18:15.690 --> 00:18:19.140
Sh-Shuuei, you can't be that strong!

00:18:19.140 --> 00:18:21.530
You're being rather rude.

00:18:21.530 --> 00:18:26.000
It might not look like it, but only Koku and
Haku-daishogun in the Urin Army can defeat me.

00:18:27.110 --> 00:18:31.770
Having said that, only the two daishogun have ever seen my real strength.

00:18:31.770 --> 00:18:33.450
Y-You're lying!

00:18:33.450 --> 00:18:35.520
Sou-Taifuu taught me my sword skills!

00:18:35.520 --> 00:18:36.990
I have to be strong!

00:18:36.990 --> 00:18:38.890
I won't accept this!

00:18:39.490 --> 00:18:41.430
Strength should be kept hidden inside oneself.

00:18:42.230 --> 00:18:45.360
That's the family precept I was taught when I studied with the Shiba family.

00:18:45.360 --> 00:18:47.590
I hardly ever show my true strength.

00:18:47.590 --> 00:18:51.470
In other words, Your Highness has seen something very rare today.

00:18:52.830 --> 00:18:54.800
That's my answer.

00:18:58.060 --> 00:19:03.520
From now on, I won't just go along
when you pursue your personal goals.

00:19:03.520 --> 00:19:06.400
When I need to disagree with you, I will.

00:19:06.400 --> 00:19:10.850
Well, I might come along on occasional incognito visits for a break.

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:14.630
But I won't hold back my opinions just to support you.

00:19:14.970 --> 00:19:18.380
I'll never lose to you on purpose again.

00:19:21.430 --> 00:19:23.390
I was impressed that you saw through me.

00:19:24.120 --> 00:19:26.780
How did you know I was going to come back to you?

00:19:29.990 --> 00:19:35.310
Your Highness gave me this, in exchange for returning the iris sword.

00:19:35.910 --> 00:19:38.820
This was definitely Yuushun-dono's idea, wasn't it?

00:19:39.660 --> 00:19:44.590
I can't imagine Your Highness doing something so thoughtful, since Your Highness always misses the point.

00:19:45.920 --> 00:19:47.220
Do you remember?

00:19:47.220 --> 00:19:48.660
We played go last spring,

00:19:48.660 --> 00:19:51.500
and ate Shuuei dumplings as a snack.

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:55.910
Yuushun suggested that I play go with you.

00:19:55.910 --> 00:19:58.370
He said, "If Shuuei gets serious and defeats you,

00:19:58.370 --> 00:20:06.260
then no matter what happens, he'll probably come back to you in the end, so don't be disheartened."

00:20:07.920 --> 00:20:12.730
I was still worried, but it turned out just as Yuushun predicted.

00:20:34.810 --> 00:20:37.450
I, Ran Shuuei, from this moment,

00:20:37.450 --> 00:20:40.880
take an oath from my heart to serve
Your Highness for the rest of his life.

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:45.180
I devote my true sword to my lord.

00:20:47.390 --> 00:20:50.410
Let's go home, Shuuei, right away.

00:20:50.410 --> 00:20:52.930
I am the Emperor.

00:20:54.090 --> 00:20:54.960
Yes, my lord.

00:21:03.490 --> 00:21:06.010
Shuurei-dono, do you have a moment?

00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:08.630
Ran-shogun!

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:21.710
Everything that you wanted to investigate should be in here.

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:23.880
What? But why?

00:21:24.330 --> 00:21:26.720
With this you can go home now, right?

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:31.110
Just send a letter to Governor Kyou that says you're returning to Kiyou.

00:21:31.110 --> 00:21:33.100
I've obtained a ship, so let's go back together.

00:21:34.090 --> 00:21:37.810
That means you'll be returning with us, Ran-shogun?

00:21:38.790 --> 00:21:43.980
By the way, Shuurei-dono, you never tried to stop me when I was leaving.

00:21:43.980 --> 00:21:47.420
Was that because you knew I'd return to the Emperor?

00:21:47.930 --> 00:21:48.700
No.

00:21:48.980 --> 00:21:52.210
Everybody has different priorities,

00:21:52.210 --> 00:21:58.340
so there was nothing I could say when you had made a decision after such careful consideration.

00:21:59.140 --> 00:22:00.330
However...

00:22:00.330 --> 00:22:01.630
However?

00:22:02.130 --> 00:22:09.620
If you'd really left Ryuuki, and he had ordered me to bring you back,

00:22:09.620 --> 00:22:13.010
I was prepared to persuade you, no matter what it took.

00:22:28.380 --> 00:22:31.370
I wonder if this is their final mercy?

00:22:31.650 --> 00:22:34.540
My brothers actually lent me a ship.

00:22:34.970 --> 00:22:37.620
You've got a winning raffle ticket too.

00:22:37.910 --> 00:22:38.700
What?

00:22:47.680 --> 00:22:48.510
Huh?

00:22:57.370 --> 00:22:58.640
Ryuuren!

00:22:59.250 --> 00:23:01.960
My soul friend number one and her friends,

00:23:01.960 --> 00:23:05.990
I will send you to Kiyou at three times the average speed!

00:23:15.120 --> 00:23:16.410
To Kiyou!

00:24:45.370 --> 00:24:50.250
Is it just my imagination,
or has Ryuuki become more like an Emperor?

00:24:50.250 --> 00:24:52.970
Maybe he's become more conscious that he really is the Emperor?

00:24:52.970 --> 00:24:56.970
Now, many people are waiting for us. Let's return to Kiyou!
